    "html": "<p>Two parallel conducting plates are separated by 5.0 cm. The variation of electric potential with distance between the plates is shown.</p>\n<p><figure data-asset-id=\"fig_01\"><img alt=\"Source question diagram 1\" src=\"asset:fig_01\"/></figure></p>\n<p>What is the magnitude of the electric field strength between the plates?<br/><br/></p>\n<p>[1]</p>\n<ol class=\"mcq-options\"><li data-label=\"A\">4.0 N C<sup>−1</sup></li><li data-label=\"B\">1.0 × 10<sup>3</sup> N C<sup>−1</sup></li><li data-label=\"C\">1.0 × 10<sup>5</sup> N C<sup>−1</sup></li><li data-label=\"D\">4.0 × 10<sup>5</sup> N C<sup>−1</sup></li></ol>"
